Mongoose:  a library from npm .A library that creates a connection between Mongodb and Node.js javascript runtime environment
 mongoshell performs all the task that mongoose performs
 but we cannot use mongoshell for our apps or complex queries instead we choose mongoose that helps us create a schemas and handle complex queries. 
it is an odm (object data modelling) library--The Object-Oriented Data Model (OODM) in DBMS represents data as objects that encapsulate both data (attributes) and the behavior (methods) associated with them.
objects that encapsulate both data (attributes) and the behavior (methods) associated with them. Unlike traditional Relational Databases (RDBMS) which store information in tables, rows, and columns, an OODM bridges the gap between database systems and object-oriented programming (OOP) languages like Java, C++, or Python. It allows the direct storage of complex real-world entities and rich media formats (such as audio, video, and images) natively.
modelling --> models-->  the word model refers to an abstract framework or blueprint that defines how data is structured, stored, manipulated, and conceptualised.

